{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>עניו</b> Written ענו (defective), for its numerical value is ענ\"ו — עניו = 126. ענ\"ו = 126. The matter: six days, then three times forty. From ״מים בהר ויכסהו״ — the cloud covered him six days, then three periods of forty." "<b>ענו</b> In gematria: בעדן — for he inherits Garden of Eden. ענו = 126. בעדן = 126."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {0 "The comment juxtaposes the defective spelling ענו (value 126) with the phrase ענ״ו and a tradition that Moses was secluded six days then three sets of forty days. The clause beginning מים בהר ויכסהו is cryptic and the syntax is elliptical; translated hyper-literally."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:59.632782437Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}